
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Sorry Baby ❤️</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff758c, #ff7eb3, #a18cd1);
  overflow-x: hidden;
  color: white;
}

.container {
  width: 90%;
  max-width: 420px;
  padding: 30px 22px;
  text-align: center;
  border-radius: 25px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.17);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 35px #0003;
}

.heart {
  font-size: 65px;
  animation: beat 1s infinite;
}

@keyframes beat {
  50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
}

h1 {
  margin: 15px 0;
  font-size: 35px;
}

p {
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 15px 0;
}

button {
  padding: 14px 25px;
  margin: 10px 5px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.yes {
  background: white;
  color: #ff4081;
}

.time {
  background: #8e2457;
  color: white;
}

#message {
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-weight: bold;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

  <div class="heart">❤️</div>

  <h1>Sorry Baby 🥺</h1>

  <p>
    I know you're angry with me,
    and I understand your feelings.
  </p>

  <p>
    The message to your sister was sent
    accidentally by my friend.
    I never wanted to hurt you.
  </p>

  <p>
    Please don't end our relationship
    because of this misunderstanding.
    Give me one more chance.
  </p>

  <p>
    I promise I'll be more careful
    and won't let this happen again.
  </p>

  <h3>Can we give our love one more chance? 💗</h3>

  <button class="yes" onclick="yesClick()">
    YES ❤️
  </button>

  <button class="time" onclick="timeClick()">
    I NEED TIME 🥺
  </button>

  <div id="message"></div>

</div>

<script>

function yesClick() {
  document.getElementById("message").innerHTML =
  "Thank you, Baby! ❤️🥺 I promise to listen, understand and make things better. You mean so much to me! 💕";
}

function timeClick() {
  document.getElementById("message").innerHTML =
  "I understand, Baby. Take your time. I'll respect your feelings. ❤️";
}

</script>

</body>
</html>
